ceful sports car of the 1950's  he notes that it doesn't have the showy  radiator grilles of the Mercedes 190 or  [ __ ] warred Isabella ku pays but he says  the key is not really a sports car  because under its wonderful body is  standard beetle technology in this case  a one and a half liter boxer engine from  1966 which is 44 horsepower Christoph  says while the Kia won't win races  it does win hearts especially once as  lovely is this in original condition  it's got just 33,000 kilometers on the  clock now he's taking this exceptional  model out for a spin  this Karmann Ghia is from the automobile  milestones collection at the site House  Museum in wolf sport the sporting Ghia  Kupe was the first to offer elegant  Italian design at an affordable price  this was made possible by combining the  Jia's sheet metal body with  cost-effective series production  technology christophe says the car was  mocked as being a Porsche for rich  housewives and even impostor but if the  Karmann Ghia was an imposter it was a  very successful one it was produced for  close to 20 years during which time  443,000 coupe pays and convertibles were  sold our tester says those are sales  figures many real sports cars and only  dream of and these days many people can  only dream of owning a car mid-year  convertibles in mint condition so for  over twenty five thousand euros while  COO pays change hands for around 18,000  not bad for a beetle variant that  originally sold for just over 3500 euros  our tester calls the Karmann Ghia the  perfect car for people who like to look  sharp and have time to spare personally  he like a few more horsepower that he  says the cars wonderful design  compensates for a lot and makes this car  a truth automotive milestone
 

